On 1/18/07, Gabriel R <grecchia@gmail.com> wrote:
> Are there any programs available that convert Lojban sentences into a more
> standard first-order logic representation, or vice versa?

I don't think so. Converting from FOL to Lojban should be (relatively)
easy, but Lojban to FOL is probably impossible, as there are many
features of Lojban that don't have any equivalent in FOL. Perhaps a
very restricted subset of Lojban could be.

